[33.450896, "o", "=== customers.csv ===\r\n  account_id          company_name     segment region  is_enterprise_legacy\r\n0   acct_001   Northwind Analytics  Mid-Market    NaN                 False\r\n1   acct_002  Alpine Cloud Systems  Enterprise   EMEA                  True\r\n2   acct_003     PixelWorks Studio         SMB    NaN                 False\r\n\r\n=== usage_logs.csv ===\r\n  account_id service_month  api_calls\r\n0   acct_001       2026-01      85000\r\n1   acct_001       2026-02     145000\r\n2   acct_001       2026-03      92000\r\n3   acct_002       2026-01     175000\r\n4   acct_002       2026-02      88000\r\n5   acct_002       2026-03     350000\r\n6   acct_003       2026-01      76000\r\n7   acct_003       2026-02     132000\r\n8   acct_003       2026-03     220000\r\n\r\n=== fx_rates.csv ===\r\n     month currency  usd_rate\r\n0  2026-01      USD     1.000\r\n1  2026-01      EUR     1.085\r\n2  2026-02      USD     1.000\r\n3  2026-02      EUR     1.092\r\n4  2026-03      USD     1.000\r\n5  2026-03      EUR     1.079\r\n\r\n=== support_tickets.csv ===\r\n  ticket_id account_id created_date                       subject                                                                                                                                                                               notes\r\n0   TKT-001   acct_002   2026-04-03  Overage Discount Not Applied                                                               Enterprise Legacy account per contract addendum section 4. Verify 8% discount applied to all Q1 2026 overage charges.\r\n1   TKT-002   acct_003   2026-04-07    Tax Charged on API Overage  February invoice includes USD 10.24 sales tax on overage line. Per contract clause 7.2 and pricing addendum tax policy sales tax is excluded from usage billing. Credit requested.\r\n\r\n=== legacy_call_adjustments.xlsx ===\r\nSheet names: ['Adjustments']\r\nSheet: Adjustments\r\n  account_id service_month  billable_calls  tier2_calls\r\n0   acct_001       2026-02             NaN          NaN\r\n1   acct_002       2026-03             NaN          NaN\r\n\r\n=== PDF: pricing_addendum.pdf ===\r\n--- Page 1 ---\r\nAbundant Cloud Platform — Pricing Addendum\r\nEffective: January 1, 2026\r\nUsage Pricing Tiers\r\nEach account includes 100,000 API calls per calendar month at no additional charge.\r\nTier 1 Overage: calls 100,001 through 200,000 are billed at USD 0.002 per call.\r\nTier 2 Overage: calls above 200,000 are billed at USD 0.0015 per call.\r\nBillable overage is rounded UP to the nearest 1,000 calls before rate application.\r\nEnterprise Legacy Discount\r\nAccounts designated as Enterprise Legacy in the customer registry receive an 8%\r\ndiscount applied to total overage charges. The discount is applied after tier rate\r\ncalculation and before any tax. Discount applies to all overage tiers.\r\nTax Policy\r\nSales tax and VAT are excluded from usage overage charges in billing reconciliation\r\naudits. Where tax appears on an invoice overage line, it must be separated and\r\nclassified as line_type='tax' in the extracted invoice lines.\r\nRegional Currency Policy\r\nEMEA accounts are invoiced in EUR. Billing reconciliation is performed in USD\r\nusing the monthly usd_rate from fx_rates.csv for the service month.\r\nLegacy Billing Adjustments\r\nAccount-months listed in legacy_call_adjustments.xlsx carry authoritative call-count\r\nvalues from the prior billing system. Interpret those cells using standard Excel\r\nformula semantics.\r\nDispute Severity Framework\r\nHigh — sales tax or VAT included in usage overage charges.\r\nMedium — Enterprise Legacy discount not applied to invoice overage, tier\r\narithmetic errors, or rounding errors.\r\nLow — immaterial per-call rate variance below the audit materiality threshold.\r\nBase Plan\r\nBase plan subscription charges are USD 500.00 per account per month.\r\nBase plan lines are not subject to dispute review in this audit.\r\n\r\n\r\n=== PDF: invoices/invoice_acct_001.pdf ===\r\n--- Page 1 ---\r\nNorthwind Analytics — Q1 2026 Invoice\r\nAccount ID: acct_001  |  Billing Period: January – March 2026\r\nCurrency: USD\r\nsource_file              | account_id | month   | line_description         | quantity | u"]
[33.450967, "o", "nit_price | amount_usd | line_type\r\ninvoice_acct_001.pdf     | acct_001   | 2026-01 | Monthly Subscription     | 1        | 500.0000   | 500.00     | base_plan\r\ninvoice_acct_001.pdf     | acct_001   | 2026-01 | API Overage Calls        | 0        | 0.0020     | 0.00       | overage\r\ninvoice_acct_001.pdf     | acct_001   | 2026-02 | Monthly Subscription     | 1        | 500.0000   | 500.00     | base_plan\r\ninvoice_acct_001.pdf     | acct_001   | 2026-02 | API Overage (46,000 calls) | 46000    | 0.0020     | 92.00      | overage\r\ninvoice_acct_001.pdf     | acct_001   | 2026-03 | Monthly Subscription     | 1        | 500.0000   | 500.00     | base_plan\r\ninvoice_acct_001.pdf     | acct_001   | 2026-03 | API Overage Calls        | 0        | 0.0020     | 0.00       | overage\r\nInvoice Total: USD 1,592.00\r\n\r\n\r\n=== PDF: invoices/invoice_acct_002.pdf ===\r\n--- Page 1 ---\r\nAlpine Cloud Systems — Q1 2026 Statement of Charges\r\nAccount ID: acct_002\r\nBilling Period: January 2026 – March 2026  |  Currency: EUR\r\nJanuary 2026\r\n  Base Plan Subscription ................................ EUR 500.00\r\n  API Overage 75,000 calls .............................. EUR 150.00\r\n  January Subtotal: EUR 650.00\r\nFebruary 2026\r\n  Base Plan Subscription ................................ EUR 500.00\r\n  No API overage charges this month.\r\n"]
