 acct_001       2026-02             NaN          NaN\r\n1   acct_002       2026-03             NaN          NaN\r\n\r\n=== PDF: pricing_addendum.pdf ===\r\n--- Page 1 ---\r\nAbundant Cloud Platform — Pricing Addendum\r\nEffective: January 1, 2026\r\nUsage Pricing Tiers\r\nEach account includes 100,000 API calls per calendar month at no additional charge.\r\nTier 1 Overage: calls 100,001 through 200,000 are billed at USD 0.002 per call.\r\nTier 2 Overage: calls above 200,000 are billed at USD 0.0015 per call.\r\nBillable overage is rounded UP to the nearest 1,000 calls before rate application.\r\nEnterprise Legacy Discount\r\nAccounts designated as Enterprise Legacy in the customer registry receive an 8%\r\ndiscount applied to total overage charges. The discount is applied after tier rate\r\ncalculation and before any tax. Discount applies to all overage tiers.\r\nTax Policy\r\nSales tax and VAT are excluded from usage overage charges in billing reconciliation\r\naudits. Where tax appears on an invoice overage line, it must be separated and\r\nclassified as line_type='tax' in the extracted invoice lines.\r\nRegional Currency Policy\r\nEMEA accounts are invoiced in EUR. Billing reconciliation is performed in USD\r\nusing the monthly usd_rate from fx_rates.csv for the service month.\r\nLegacy Billing Adjustments\r\nAccount-months listed in legacy_call_adjustments.xlsx carry authoritative call-count\r\nvalues from the prior billing system. Interpret those cells using standard Excel\r\nformula semantics.\r\nDispute Severity Framework\r\nHigh — sales tax or VAT included in usage overage charges.\r\nMedium — Enterprise Legacy discount not applied to invoice overage, tier\r\narithmetic errors, or rounding errors.\r\nLow — immaterial per-call rate variance below the audit materiality threshold.\r\nBase Plan\r\nBase plan subscription charges are USD 500.00 per account per month.\r\nBase plan lines are not subject to dispute review in this audit.\r\n\r\n\r\n=== PDF: invoices/invoice_acct_001.pdf ===\r\n--- Page 1 ---\r\nNorthwind Analytics — Q1 2026 Invoice\r\nAccount ID: acct_001  |  Billing Period: January – March 2026\r\nCurrency: USD\r\nsource_file              | account_id | month   | line_description         | quantity | u"]
